;; ---- forms (v1.6): <form>, <input> text/password/hidden/checkbox/radio/submit/button, <button> ----
;; Slots: 1088 focused entry (-1 none), 1089 entry count, 1091 current <form> tag index (-1), 1092/1093/1094
;; <button> start px/row/entry (-1 none), 1095 POST body pending in the line buffer, 1096 pending submit
;; trigger entry (-1), 1097 window handle, 1098 total rows of the last pass.
;; Entry k at 1100+14k (k < 24): +0 tag index, +1 value length (-1 = not initialised yet), +2 checked,
;; +3 owning form tag index, +4 kind (1 text, 2 password, 3 hidden, 4 checkbox, 5 radio, 6 button),
;; +5 name hash, +6..+13 value bytes (4 per slot, 32 max).
